[9.32,"o","The user chooses how unstale reads new release notes. Show them these options as printed and ask.\r\n"]
[9.38,"o","Never choose for them.\r\n"]
[9.44,"o","\r\n"]
[9.5,"o","     Read with                Cost a year, this repo        Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[9.56,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway  ≈ $0.11                       the best option\r\n"]
[9.62,"o","  2  Jev + Codex plan         ≈ $0.053 + 500k Codex tokens  ≈ 80% of its changes\r\n"]
[9.68,"o","  3  Vercel AI Gateway        ≈ $0.19                       ≈ 3% less precise labels\r\n"]
[9.74,"o","  4  Codex plan               ≈ 1.9M Codex tokens           ≈ 80% of its changes; rest not measured\r\n"]
[9.8,"o","  5  Anthropic                ≈ $0.23                       ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[9.86,"o","  6  Not now                  free                          ≈ 27% of its changes in new releases\r\n"]
[9.92,"o","     Jev: a labelling service, used beside the provider that reads the notes.\r\n"]
[9.98,"o","     Keys: JEV_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\r\n"]
[10.04,"o","\r\n"]
[10.1,"o","Record their answer with the matching command:\r\n"]
[10.16,"o","  1  unstale setup --inference jev+env:AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY\r\n"]
